  "_model_policy": "Enterprise buys thoroughness, not wall-clock. No phase is downgraded except research (evidence-gathering, and spec re-reads its output at opus). The terminal artifacts are NOT downgrade candidates here the way they are at beta: design carries i18n + a11y_full and test_plan carries load/soak/nonfunctional — both are compliance surface at this tier. If an enterprise megaplan is too slow, the lever is the tier, not the model.",
